  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cambi Group AS Feasibility study phase II Colombia and South Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cambi Group AS applied for and was granted Norad support for project development work (feasibility studies) to develop a portfolio of waste water projects including bio energy in Colombia, South-Africa, Nigeria and Ghana on a PPP (public private partnership) model.</narrative>
  </description>
